[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3081953158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108667#issuecomment-3081953158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108667","id":3081953158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63st-G","user":{"login":"Draknek","id":184057,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDA1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek","html_url":"https://github.com/Draknek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T00:33:16Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T00:33:16Z","body":"I should add: IMO there's probably two possible fixes here\n\n1. Quick and easy: add that line to the default `gradle.properties` file (will definitely fix the problem, potentially means that subsequent android builds in the same session may be slightly slower than they would be otherwise but I'm not sure by how much)\n2. If we make a build with gradle, set a flag. When Godot is quitting, if that flag is set, run `gradle --stop` which should kill the daemon (untested)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3081953158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3713094232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108667#issuecomment-3713094232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108667","id":3713094232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dUVJY","user":{"login":"skmyan","id":226445444,"node_id":"U_kgDODX9IhA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226445444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan","html_url":"https://github.com/skmyan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T04:45:50Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T04:45:50Z","body":"Can we do something like this?\n\n\nPost-Export Daemon Stop:\nIn build script (after Godot export command): `gradle - - stop`\n\nThe stop command is a built-in gradle feature that terminates the gradle.\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3713094232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3714345937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108667#issuecomment-3714345937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108667","id":3714345937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dZGvR","user":{"login":"Draknek","id":184057,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDA1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek","html_url":"https://github.com/Draknek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Draknek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T11:25:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T11:25:37Z","body":"Probably that won't work, because if you're experiencing this issue, `godot_console.exe` won't exit so it will never proceed to the next part of the script to run `gradle --stop`.\n\nEditing the `android/build/gradle.properties` file, as described above, is probably the best solution for any end user who doesn't want to touch the Godot source code.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3714345937/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027759034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108667#issuecomment-5027759034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108667","id":5027759034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK62Dug","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T22:09:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T22:09:02Z","body":"Two additions that might help: the hang is specific to the **console** executable, and there's a workaround that doesn't touch `gradle.properties`.\n\n**The non-console executable exits normally.** Measured on 4.7.1-stable, same project (Gradle build) and same command:\n\n| binary | result |\n|---|---|\n| `Godot_v4.7.1-stable_win64_console.exe` | hangs (no exit in 150s), APK written |\n| `Godot_v4.7.1-stable_win64.exe` | exits in ~22s, APK written |\n\nSo for automated/headless Android exports, using the **non-console** binary avoids the hang without editing `gradle.properties`.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027759034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]